    '/' is integer division (floor). No eval() is used; this is a
    recursive descent parser.

    Grammar:
        expr   := term (('+' | '-') term)*
        term   := factor (('*' | '/') factor)*
        factor := ('+' | '-') factor | '(' expr ')' | number
    """
